<domain_requirements>
Several waiters share a mutex and a condition variable, and a notifier wakes one waiter. Every interleaving must terminate and every waiter must complete. On completion the program must print exactly one line `DONE waiters=0` and then exit; it must terminate.
</domain_requirements>

